# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# drafthole.part -- Rounds along ellipses, where a hole meets drafted faces
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# A block whose sides lean in by a draft of 3 degrees along z, with a
# counterbored hole through it along x: the counterbore meets the
# drafted side at x = 0, and the hole the one at x = 50, at a slant,
# along ellipses, which rounds of 1 follow as pipes, each round its
# rim in two halves that run on into each other.  The floor of the
# counterbore and its edge stay sharp.
profile blk along z 0 0 0 50 0 0 50 30 0 0 30 0
extrude b from 0 to 40 blk draft 3
circle h 8 15 20 along x
circle cb 14 15 20 along x
extrude hole from -1 to 51 h
extrude bore from -1 to 6 cb
subtract part b hole bore
round 1 b.side hole
round 1 b.side bore
